#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of OpenJDK"
msgstr "Instalação do OpenJDK"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid "If you have downloaded the optional test harness, unpack it now:"
msgstr "Se você baixou o equipamento opcional de teste, desempacote-o agora:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:214
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>tar -xf ../jtreg-&jtreg-version;.tar.gz</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>tar -xf ../jtreg-&jtreg-version;.tar.gz</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Before proceeding, you should ensure that your environment "
"<envar>PATH</envar> variable contains the location of the Java compiler used"
" for bootstrapping <application>OpenJDK</application>.  This is the only "
"requirement for the environment. Modern Java installations do not need "
"<envar>JAVA_HOME</envar> and <envar>CLASSPATH</envar> is not used here. "
"Furthermore, OpenJDK developers recommend unsetting <envar>JAVA_HOME</envar>"
" and <envar>CLASSPATH</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Antes de continuar, você deveria garantir que sua variável de ambiente "
"<envar>PATH</envar> contenha o local do compilador Java usado para "
"inicializar o <application>OpenJDK</application>. Essa é a única exigência "
"para o ambiente. Instalações modernas Java não precisam de "
"<envar>JAVA_HOME</envar>; e <envar>CLASSPATH</envar> não é usado aqui. Além "
"disso, os(as) desenvolvedores(as) do OpenJDK recomendam desconfigurar "
"<envar>JAVA_HOME</envar> e <envar>CLASSPATH</envar>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The build system does not allow the <option>-j</option> switch in "
"<envar>MAKEFLAGS</envar>. See the command explanation for <option>--with-"
"jobs=</option> for more information on customizing parallelization."
msgstr ""
"O sistema de construção não permite a chave &quot;<option>-j</option>&quot; "
"em &quot;<envar>MAKEFLAGS</envar>&quot;. Veja-se a explicação do comando "
"para &quot;<option>--with-jobs=</option>&quot; para mais informações "
"relativas a personalizar a paralelização."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid "Configure and build the package with the following commands:"
msgstr "Configure e construa o pacote com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:253
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export MAKEFLAGS_HOLD=$MAKEFLAGS           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  JAVA_HOME                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  CLASSPATH                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  MAKEFLAGS                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"bash configure --enable-unlimited-crypto    \\\n"
"               --disable-warnings-as-errors \\\n"
"               --with-stdc++lib=dynamic     \\\n"
"               --with-giflib=system         \\\n"
"               --with-harfbuzz=system       \\\n"
"               --with-jtreg=$PWD/jtreg      \\\n"
"               --with-lcms=system           \\\n"
"               --with-libjpeg=system        \\\n"
"               --with-libpng=system         \\\n"
"               --with-zlib=system           \\\n"
"               --with-version-build=\"&openjdk-build;\"     \\\n"
"               --with-version-pre=\"\"        \\\n"
"               --with-version-opt=\"\"        \\\n"
"               --with-jobs=<replaceable>$(nproc)</replaceable>         \\\n"
"               --with-cacerts-file=/etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts &amp;&amp;\n"
"make images</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export MAKEFLAGS_HOLD=$MAKEFLAGS           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  JAVA_HOME                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  CLASSPATH                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  MAKEFLAGS                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"bash configure --enable-unlimited-crypto    \\\n"
"               --disable-warnings-as-errors \\\n"
"               --with-stdc++lib=dynamic     \\\n"
"               --with-giflib=system         \\\n"
"               --with-harfbuzz=system       \\\n"
"               --with-jtreg=$PWD/jtreg      \\\n"
"               --with-lcms=system           \\\n"
"               --with-libjpeg=system        \\\n"
"               --with-libpng=system         \\\n"
"               --with-zlib=system           \\\n"
"               --with-version-build=\"&openjdk-build;\"     \\\n"
"               --with-version-pre=\"\"        \\\n"
"               --with-version-opt=\"\"        \\\n"
"               --with-jobs=<replaceable>$(nproc)</replaceable>         \\\n"
"               --with-cacerts-file=/etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts &amp;&amp;\n"
"make images</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, you will need to execute the jtreg program.  You can "
"set the number of concurrent tests by adding the "
"<parameter>-conc:<replaceable>&lt;X&gt;</replaceable></parameter> value in "
"the below command (tests will run sequentially otherwise):"
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, você precisará executar o aplicativo "
"&quot;jtreg&quot;. Você consegue configurar o número de testes simultâneos "
"adicionando o valor "
"&quot;<parameter>-conc:<replaceable>&lt;X&gt;</replaceable></parameter>&quot;"
" no comando abaixo (caso contrário, os testes executarão sequencialmente):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:281
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export JT_JAVA=$(echo $PWD/build/*/jdk) &amp;&amp;\n"
"jtreg/bin/jtreg -jdk:$JT_JAVA -automatic -ignore:quiet -v1 \\\n"
"    test/jdk:tier1 test/langtools:tier1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset JT_JAVA</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export JT_JAVA=$(echo $PWD/build/*/jdk) &amp;&amp;\n"
"jtreg/bin/jtreg -jdk:$JT_JAVA -automatic -ignore:quiet -v1 \\\n"
"   test/jdk:tier1 test/langtools:tier1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset JT_JAVA</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:287
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For more control over the test suite, review the documentation available in "
"<filename>jtreg/doc/jtreg/usage.txt</filename>. To review the results, see "
"the files <filename>JTreport/test_{jdk,langtools}/text/stats.txt</filename> "
"and <filename>JTreport/test_{jdk,langtools}/text/summary.txt</filename>.  "
"You should expect to see around 80 failures and 10 errors."
msgstr ""
"Para mais controle sobre a suíte de teste, revise a documentação disponível "
"em <filename>jtreg/doc/jtreg/usage.txt</filename>. Para revisar os "
"resultados, vejam-se os arquivos "
"<filename>JTreport/test_{jdk,langtools}/text/stats.txt</filename> e "
"<filename>JTreport/test_{jdk,langtools}/text/summary.txt</filename>. Você "
"deveria esperar ver cerca de oitenta (80) falhas e dez (10) erros."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:348
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the package with the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o pacote com os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:352
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build;             &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv build/*/images/jdk/* /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R root:root /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build;          &amp;&amp;\n"
"for s in 16 24 32 48; do\n"
"  install -vDm644 src/java.desktop/unix/classes/sun/awt/X11/java-icon${s}.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/icons/hicolor/${s}x${s}/apps/java.png\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build;             &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv build/*/images/jdk/* /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R root:root /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build;          &amp;&amp;\n"
"for s in 16 24 32 48; do\n"
"  install -vDm644 src/java.desktop/unix/classes/sun/awt/X11/java-icon${s}.png \\\n"
"                 /usr/share/icons/hicolor/${s}x${s}/apps/java.png\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:362
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you only wish to install the Java Runtime Environment, you can substitute"
" <filename>build/*/images/jre</filename> in the above <command>cp</command> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Se desejar instalar somente o &quot;Java Runtime Environment&quot;, [então] "
"você pode substituir &quot;<filename>build/*/images/jre</filename>&quot; no "
"comando &quot;<command>cp</command>&quot; acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:369
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There will be plenty of binaries with debug info that take up over half of "
"the installed size. If you don't care about debugging, you can remove the "
"info:"
msgstr ""
"Existirão muitos binários com informações de depuração que ocuparão mais da "
"metade do tamanho instalado. Se não se importar com depuração, você pode "
"remover as informações:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:374
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>find /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; -name *.debuginfo"
" -delete</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>find /opt/jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; -name *.debuginfo"
" -delete</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:377
#, xml-text
msgid "Restore the <envar>MAKEFLAGS</envar> variable:"
msgstr "Restaure a variável <envar>MAKEFLAGS</envar>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:380
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export MAKEFLAGS=$MAKEFLAGS_HOLD &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  MAKEFLAGS_HOLD</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export MAKEFLAGS=$MAKEFLAGS_HOLD &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset  MAKEFLAGS_HOLD</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are now two <application>OpenJDK</application> SDKs installed in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>. You should decide on which "
"one you would like to use as the default. Normally, you would opt for the "
"just installed <application>OpenJDK</application>. If so, do the following "
"as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora existem dois &quot;SDKs&quot; "
"&quot;<application>OpenJDK</application>&quot; instalados em &quot;<filename"
" class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>&quot;. Você deveria decidir qual deles "
"gostaria de usar como padrão. Normalmente, você optaria pelo recém-instalado"
" &quot;<application>OpenJDK</application>&quot;. Nesse caso, faça o seguinte"
" como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:392
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -v -nsf jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; "
"/opt/jdk</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -v -nsf jdk-&openjdk-version;+&openjdk-build; "
"/opt/jdk</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, you can create .desktop files to add entries in the menu for "
"<command>java</command> and <command>jconsole</command>. The needed icons "
"have already been installed. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, você pode criar arquivos &quot;.desktop&quot; para adicionar "
"entradas no menu para &quot;<command>java</command>&quot; e "
"&quot;<command>jconsole</command>&quot;. Os ícones necessários já foram "
"instalados. Como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:401
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/openjdk-java.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Runtime\n"
"Comment=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Runtime\n"
"Exec=/opt/jdk/bin/java -jar\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=java\n"
"MimeType=application/x-java-archive;application/java-archive;application/x-jar;\n"
"NoDisplay=true</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/openjdk-jconsole.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Console\n"
"Comment=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Console\n"
"Keywords=java;console;monitoring\n"
"Exec=/opt/jdk/bin/jconsole\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=java\n"
"Categories=Application;System;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/openjdk-java.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Tempo de Execução\n"
"Comment=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Tempo de Execução\n"
"Exec=/opt/jdk/bin/java -jar\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=java\n"
"MimeType=application/x-java-archive;application/java-archive;application/x-jar;\n"
"NoDisplay=true</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/openjdk-jconsole.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Console\n"
"Comment=OpenJDK Java &openjdk-version; Console\n"
"Keywords=java;console;monitoramento\n"
"Exec=/opt/jdk/bin/jconsole\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Icon=java\n"
"Categories=Application;System;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:429
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:432
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>bash configure...</command>: the top level "
"<filename>configure</filename> is a wrapper around the autotools one.  It is"
" not executable and must be run through <command>bash</command>."
msgstr ""
"<command>bash configure...</command>: o "
"&quot;<filename>configure</filename>&quot; do nível superior é um envólucro "
"em torno daquele do &quot;autotools&quot;. Ele não é executável e precisa "
"ser executado por intermédio do &quot;<command>bash</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:443
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-unlimited-crypto</parameter>: Because of limitations on "
"the usage of cryptography in some countries, there is the possibility to "
"limit the size of encryption keys and the use of some algorithms in a policy"
" file. This switch allows to ship a policy file with no restriction. It is "
"the responsibility of the user to ensure proper adherence to the law."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-unlimited-crypto</parameter>: Devido às limitações no "
"uso de criptografia em alguns países, existe a possibilidade de limitar o "
"tamanho das chaves de encriptação e o uso de alguns algoritmos em um arquivo"
" de política. Essa chave permite enviar um arquivo de política sem "
"restrições. É responsabilidade do(a) usuário(a) garantir a adequada "
"aderência à legislação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:452
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-warnings-as-errors</parameter>: This switch disables "
"use of <envar>-Werror</envar> in the build."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-warnings-as-errors</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o"
" uso de &quot;<envar>-Werror</envar>&quot; na construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:457
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-stdc++lib=dynamic</parameter>: This switch forces the "
"build system to link to <filename>libstdc++.so</filename> (dynamic)  instead"
" of <filename>libstdc++.a</filename> (static)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-stdc++lib=dynamic</parameter>: Essa chave força o sistema "
"de construção a vincular-se a &quot;<filename>libstdc++.so</filename>&quot; "
"(dinâmica) em vez de &quot;<filename>libstdc++.a</filename>&quot; "
"(estática)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:463
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-jobs=<replaceable>$(nproc)</replaceable></parameter>: The "
"<parameter>-j</parameter> passed to make does not work with make as invoked "
"here. By default, the build system will use the number of CPUs - 1."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-jobs=<replaceable>$(nproc)</replaceable></parameter>: O "
"<parameter>-j</parameter> passado para make não funciona com make como "
"invocado aqui. Por padrão, o sistema de construção usará o número de CPUs – "
"1."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:470
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-jtreg=$PWD/jtreg</parameter>: This switch tells configure "
"where to find jtreg. Omit if you have not downloaded the optional test "
"suite."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-jtreg=$PWD/jtreg</parameter>: Essa chave informa ao "
"&quot;configure&quot; onde encontrar o &quot;jtreg&quot;. Omita se você não "
"baixou a suíte opcional de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:476
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-{giflib,harfbuzz,lcms,libjpeg,libpng,zlib}=system</parameter>:"
" These switches force the build system to use the system libraries instead "
"of the bundled versions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-{giflib,harfbuzz,lcms,libjpeg,libpng,zlib}=system</parameter>:"
" Essas chaves forçam o sistema de construção a usar as bibliotecas do "
"sistema em vez das versões incluídas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:482
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-version-build</parameter>: Currently, the build system "
"does not include the build number in the version string. It has to be "
"specified here."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-version-build</parameter>: Atualmente, o sistema de "
"construção não inclui o número da construção na sequência de caracteres da "
"versão. Ele tem que ser especificado aqui."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:488
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-version-pre</parameter>: This switch allows you to prefix "
"the version string with a custom string."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-version-pre</parameter>: Essa chave te permite prefixar a "
"sequência de caracteres da versão com uma sequência personalizada de "
"caracteres."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:493
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-version-opt</parameter>: This switch allows you to add an "
"optional build description to the version string."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-version-opt</parameter>: Essa chave te permite adicionar "
"uma descrição opcional da construção à sequência de caracteres de versão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:498
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-cacerts-file=/etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts</parameter>: "
"Specifies where to find a <filename>cacerts</filename> file, "
"<filename>/etc/pki/tls/java/</filename> on a BLFS system. Otherwise, an "
"empty one is created. You can use the <command>/usr/sbin/make-ca "
"--force</command> command to generate it, once you have installed the Java "
"binaries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-cacerts-file=/etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts</parameter>: "
"Especifica onde encontrar um arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>cacerts</filename>&quot;, "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/pki/tls/java/</filename>&quot; em um sistema BLFS. Caso"
" contrário, um vazio será criado. Você consegue usar o comando "
"&quot;<command>/usr/sbin/make-ca --force</command>&quot; para gerá-lo, "
"depois que tenha instalado os binários &quot;Java&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:507
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-boot-jdk</option>: This switch provides the location of the "
"temporary <application>JDK</application>. It is normally not needed if "
"<command>java</command> is found in the <envar>PATH</envar>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-boot-jdk</option>: Essa chave fornece o local do "
"&quot;<application>JDK</application>&quot; temporário. Ele normalmente não é"
" necessário se &quot;<command>java</command>&quot; for encontrado no "
"&quot;<envar>PATH</envar>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:521 blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:522
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring OpenJDK"
msgstr "Configurando o OpenJDK"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:525
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:528
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Normally, the Java environment has been configured after installing the "
"binary version, and can be used with the just built package as well.  Review"
" <xref linkend=\"ojdk-conf\"/> in case you want to modify something."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, o ambiente Java é configurado depois de instalar-se a versão "
"binária e também pode ser usado com o pacote recém-construído. Revise <xref "
"linkend=\"ojdk-conf\"/> caso você queira modificar alguma coisa."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:535
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test if the man pages are correctly installed, issue <command>source "
"/etc/profile</command> and <command>man java</command> to display the "
"respective man page."
msgstr ""
"Para testar se as páginas de manual estão instaladas corretamente, emita "
"&quot;<command>source /etc/profile</command>&quot; e &quot;<command>man "
"java</command>&quot; para exibir a respectiva página de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:544
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting up the JRE Certificate Authority Certificates (cacerts) file"
msgstr ""
"Configurando o arquivo de Certificados de Autoridade Certificadora do JRE "
"(cacerts)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:548
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have run the instructions on the <xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/> page, "
"you only need to create a symlink in the default location for the "
"<filename>cacerts</filename> file. As user <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você executou as instruções na página &quot;<xref linkend=\"make-"
"ca\"/>&quot;, [então] você só precisa criar um link simbólico no local "
"padrão para o arquivo &quot;<filename>cacerts</filename>&quot;. Como "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:554
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv /etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts "
"/opt/jdk/lib/security/cacerts</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv /etc/pki/tls/java/cacerts "
"/opt/jdk/lib/security/cacerts</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:557
#, xml-text
msgid "To check the installation, issue:"
msgstr "Para verificar a instalação, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:560
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd /opt/jdk\n"
"bin/keytool -list -cacerts</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd /opt/jdk\n"
"bin/keytool -list -cacerts</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/openjdk.xml:564
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At the prompt <computeroutput>Enter keystore password:</computeroutput>, "
"enter <userinput>changeit</userinput> (the default) or just press the "
"<quote>Enter</quote> key. If the <filename>cacerts</filename> file was "
"installed correctly, you will see a list of the certificates with related "
"information for each one. If not, you need to reinstall them."
msgstr ""
"No &quot;prompt&quot; &quot;<computeroutput>Enter keystore "
"password:</computeroutput>&quot;, digite "
"&quot;<userinput>changeit</userinput>&quot; (o padrão) ou simplesmente "
"pressione a tecla <quote>Enter</quote>. Se o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>cacerts</filename>&quot; foi instalado corretamente, [então]"
" você verá uma lista dos certificados com informações relacionadas a cada "
"um. Caso contrário, você precisa reinstalá-los."

